  "title": "Lee NDE 187",
  "date": "August 1972",
  "content": "I was living in Santa Barbara that summer. I got very sick with a pneumonia-type illness. I did not go to a doctor. I did feel very ill and took cough medicine with codeine that I got from a friend. I think I just felt like I was leaving at one time. That it was impossible to be in my body. I remember a tunnel and a far off light. I remember knowing that going into the light I would not be able to come back. I struggled and then I came back. I sometimes wonder if it was real. I had never heard of a tunnel or about NDE before this happened so why do I wonder if it was real? It has always bothered me. I doubt myself yet have felt like my old religious belief is not really the way it is. My belief is more all encompassing. I am changed from this experience but still confused. I feel like I must be very imaginative yet how could I have made it up?",
